WEBVTT

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:36.860 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.990 line:0%
[Episode 15]

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.240 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.200 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang is here.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.320 line:0%
Stand still. Don't move.

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:48.040 line:0%
Wait.

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.960 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.320 line:0%
Stop!

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.200 line:0%
Release him.

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.830 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:01:53.059 --> 00:01:54.080 line:0%
In broad daylight,

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.000 line:0%
you're still trying to abduct someone?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.640 line:0%
How is this abduction?

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.170 line:0%
I simply sent someone

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:02.130 line:0%
to invite him as a guest.

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:03.960 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.760 line:0%
since he's a guest,

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:08.100 line:0%
he should be free to come and go.

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.760 line:0%
It's clear that this gentleman

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.220 line:0%
no longer wants to be here.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.400 line:0%
A mere personal matter

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.010 line:0%
has disturbed Deputy Minister Zhang.

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.870 line:0%
I wonder what kind of relationship

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.660 line:0%
between you and Mr. Han.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.670 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.240 line:0%
I was ordered to express condolences

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:28.530 line:0%
to the Grand Commander and his wife.

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.660 line:0%
I just happened to hear about this from

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.330 line:0%
the Grand Commander's wife.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.440 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has always valued you.

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:35.440 line:0%
My doing

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.150 line:0%
is also for your own good.

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:39.870 line:0%
I hope you'll reconsider, Your Highness.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.379 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.530 line:0%
Since you've already spoken,

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:49.160 line:0%
I won't force him to stay as a guest.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.620 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.120 line:0%
I shall take my leave now.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.730 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.900 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:14.780 line:0%
I have made myself clear last time.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.220 line:0%
You may be able to protect Han for now,

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:19.440 line:0%
but can you protect him forever?

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.490 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:25.680 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:26.640 line:0%
I've just received a report.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:27.560 line:0%
Multiple moth-shaped jade pieces

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.120 line:0%
have appeared

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:29.610 line:0%
in the ruins of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:30.720 line:0%
and some familiar faces have shown up.

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:31.720 line:0%
It's very strange.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:32.520 line:0%
Let's go

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:33.790 line:0%
to Jinxiu Workshop.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.480 line:0%
It's Mr. Kong, the shopkeeper of Jinxiu Workshop.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:40.960 line:0%
Isn't he already dead?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:42.040 line:0%
Is it a person or a ghost?

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.970 line:0%
Could it be that the dead can really come back to life?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.950 line:0%
You saw it just now, didn't you?

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.480 line:0%
Could it really be the work of a spirit?

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.320 line:0%
I never believe

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:03.520 line:0%
in ghosts or gods.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.800 line:0%
If there were,

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.000 line:0%
it would be someone secretly causing mischief.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.280 line:0%
If we investigate carefully,

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.520 line:0%
we'll surely find some clues.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:11.750 line:0%
I've found it!

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:14.240 line:0%
The divine signs have revealed the jade.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.530 line:0%
This moth-shaped jade must be divine jade!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:17.520 line:0%
-There must be more!
-Find it.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.259 line:0%
-I'm sure there's more!
-Find it!

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:20.360 line:0%
I found one!

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.180 line:0%
Amazing!

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:25.840 line:0%
I found another one.

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:31.710 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.720 line:0%
I have a feeling

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.600 line:0%
that behind this case

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.180 line:0%
there are two powerful forces.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.430 line:0%
One force

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:42.850 line:0%
wants to quietly erase

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:44.000 line:0%
the Jinxiu Workshop case,

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:44.880 line:0%
while the other

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:47.430 line:0%
is stirring up trouble for their own gain.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:49.840 line:0%
The moth-shaped jade.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:50.920 line:0%
The workshop owner's spirit.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.080 line:0%
The dead coming back to life.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:53.560 line:0%
All these bizarre events

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.840 line:0%
seem to have been planned

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.500 line:0%
to happen this month.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.120 line:0%
To stir up such turmoil

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.320 line:0%
in the Imperial City,

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.490 line:0%
it's not something a common

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.520 line:0%
murderer or sorcerer

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.530 line:0%
could do.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:06.010 line:0%
There must be powerful figures behind this.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.380 line:0%
But I just can't figure out

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.440 line:0%
this powerful figure's

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:12.680 line:0%
purpose.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:13.840 line:0%
Deification.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:15.720 line:0%
Deification?

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:18.400 line:0%
The current situation of this case

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:19.320 line:0%
is no longer something

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.520 line:0%
within your control.

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.720 line:0%
There are cases within the case,

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.040 line:0%
and it's intricately linked

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.370 line:0%
to the political struggles in the court.

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.600 line:0%
Then why is the killer

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:30.000 line:0%
trying to create a deity?

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.200 line:0%
What do you think?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.800 line:0%
My only thought now,

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.930 line:0%
which is also my only advice to you,

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.630 line:0%
is to stop investigating.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.760 line:0%
Don't bring trouble upon yourself.

00:05:50.760 --> 00:05:51.600 line:0%
Boring.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:52.720 line:0%
I thought

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.650 line:0%
you might have some real insights.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:57.020 line:0%
I must continue

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.720 line:0%
investigating this case.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.840 line:0%
How naive.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.120 line:0%
Don't recklessly

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.450 line:0%
put yourself in danger.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:12.640 line:0%
Are you...

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.930 line:0%
actually concerned about me?

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.310 line:0%
What do you think?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.200 line:0%
Anyway,

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.080 line:0%
you're now bearing

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.340 line:0%
the title of the Grand Commander's wife.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.620 line:0%
Behave yourself,

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:37.200 line:0%
and don't get

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.790 line:0%
yourself involved in this.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.340 line:0%
I still think you're concerned about me.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.200 line:0%
You won't let me go,

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:00.760 line:0%
but I insist on

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.420 line:0%
getting to the bottom of this.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.780 line:0%
Madam.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:16.690 line:0%
Lu Chuichui and I

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.780 line:0%
have an appointment at the silk shop in the south of the city.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.480 line:0%
I heard they've got a new batch of fabrics.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.760 line:0%
There are madder red,

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:22.480 line:0%
iris yellow,

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:23.160 line:0%
oak black,

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:24.200 line:0%
and locust yellow.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:25.600 line:0%
The tie-dyeing is so beautiful.

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.560 line:0%
I'm afraid they'll be sold out if I'm late.

00:07:27.560 --> 00:07:29.000 line:0%
Why don't you go back first?

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.320 line:0%
Don't disturb the Grand Commander.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:31.720 line:0%
He didn't rest well last night.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:32.480 line:0%
Let him sleep a bit longer.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.160 line:0%
Alright.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.520 line:0%
Go on, go on.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:37.840 line:0%
Madam, you're up so early.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.120 line:0%
Where are you heading?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.880 line:0%
Lu Chuichui and I have an appointment

00:07:40.880 --> 00:07:42.640 line:0%
at the silk shop in the south of the city

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:44.040 line:0%
to see a new batch of fabrics.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.240 line:0%
There are madder red,

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:45.920 line:0%
iris yellow,

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.560 line:0%
oak black,

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:47.200 line:0%
and locust yellow.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.360 line:0%
The tie-dyeing is so beautiful.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.820 line:0%
I'm afraid they'll be sold out if we're late.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.040 line:0%
I need to go to

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:55.840 line:0%
a silk shop in the south of the city.

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.080 line:0%
I heard they've got a new batch of fabrics.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:57.440 line:0%
Uncle Zhong,

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:57.959 line:0%
what's going on?

00:07:57.959 --> 00:07:58.520 line:0%
Iris yellow,

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:58.959 line:0%
oak black,

00:07:58.959 --> 00:07:59.280 line:0%
and locust yellow.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.280 line:0%
Did she argue with the Grand Commander again?

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.200 line:0%
I'm afraid they'll be sold out if we're late.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.730 line:0%
What are you talking about?

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.080 line:0%
Would you like some sugar cakes?

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:05.980 line:0%
I just made them.

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.580 line:0%
I was about to take them to the Grand Commander.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:12.760 line:0%
No,

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:14.720 line:0%
it's a made-up lie.

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:16.090 line:0%
What?

00:08:18.690 --> 00:08:20.080 line:0%
Mrs. Shen rushed out

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:21.360 line:0%
so early in the morning.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.040 line:0%
She must have some urgent business.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.320 line:0%
I've noticed that the Grand Commander

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.640 line:0%
hasn't had much appetite for breakfast these days.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.880 line:0%
So I made some sugar cakes.

00:08:26.880 --> 00:08:28.340 line:0%
Why don't you try some too?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:29.640 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:37.200 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.469 line:0%
Go and keep an eye on Yan Xing.

00:08:39.469 --> 00:08:40.800 line:0%
Given her temperament,

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.709 line:0%
she definitely won't listen to me.

00:08:42.709 --> 00:08:43.520 line:0%
Yes.

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:51.120 line:0%
While reviewing the entire case,

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.450 line:0%
we overlooked someone.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.840 line:0%
There was another witness

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:54.760 line:0%
who found

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:56.000 line:0%
Chen's body

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:56.560 line:0%
besides Chen Shoujie.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:57.560 line:0%
She personally cooked,

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.480 line:0%
making water-boiled mutton and smoked chicken.

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:01.240 line:0%
She also baked flatbread and pilaf.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:03.480 line:0%
She even rewarded this old servant with a bowl of wine.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.370 line:0%
How kind the madam is to us.

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.120 line:0%
That night, she personally cooked,

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.240 line:0%
making water-boiled mutton and smoked chicken.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.240 line:0%
She also baked flatbread and pilaf.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.090 line:0%
The servant of Chen Shoujie—

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:14.400 line:0%
his testimony was exactly

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.040 line:0%
the same as what the officials recorded

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.160 line:0%
when they questioned him.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.290 line:0%
The two statements were word-for-word identical.

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.540 line:0%
[Not entering the cycle of reincarnation. Immortal reincarnation]

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.680 line:0%
I'm afraid he had memorized

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:22.010 line:0%
what to say beforehand.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:26.940 line:0%
Chen Shoujie.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.640 line:0%
Where's your old servant?

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.680 line:0%
Fire moths, fire moths.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.120 line:0%
Fire moths.

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:36.500 line:0%
Fire moths, fire moths.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:38.880 line:0%
Fire moths.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:40.560 line:0%
Fire moths.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.040 line:0%
What fire moths?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.240 line:0%
Fire moths! Fire moths! Fire moths!

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:46.860 line:0%
Fire moths! Fire moths! Fire moths!

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:48.920 line:0%
Fire moths!

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.000 line:0%
Fire moths!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.080 line:0%
Fire moths!

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:08.610 line:0%
It's you.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.720 line:0%
On the day Mrs. Chen was killed,

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.910 line:0%
what exactly did you see?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.370 line:0%
Why did you fabricate your testimony?

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.380 line:0%
[Chen's Mansion]

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:32.970 line:0%
[Chen's Mansion]

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.480 line:0%
It seems like he's waiting for me.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.290 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.750 line:0%
Mingsheng Temple.

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.640 line:0%
Sounds familiar.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.170 line:0%
Excuse me,

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.640 line:0%
did you see

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:14.970 line:0%
anyone come in just now?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:36.750 line:0%
Excuse me...

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:56.640 line:0%
Help!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.400 line:0%
Back from the dead.

00:13:11.160 --> 00:13:13.100 line:0%
Back from the dead.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.300 line:0%
Back from...

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:17.330 line:0%
You can't die.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.360 line:0%
You haven't told me yet

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.650 line:0%
who the murderer is.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:25.010 line:0%
-You can't die!
-Who are you?

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:37.510 line:0%
And who are you?

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:41.680 line:0%
Why did you kill him?

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:43.730 line:0%
I didn't kill him.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.250 line:0%
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:13:45.310 --> 00:13:46.580 line:0%
You still want to deny it?

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.000 line:0%
I really didn't kill him.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:48.720 line:0%
Guards!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.400 line:0%
I didn't kill him.

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:52.920 line:0%
I just...

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:53.600 line:0%
Stop!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.600 line:0%
Greetings, Princess Runing.

00:14:05.390 --> 00:14:07.570 line:0%
Princess Runing?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:12.690 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:10.840 line:0%
Mingsheng Temple.

00:14:11.610 --> 00:14:13.410 line:0%
No wonder it sounds so familiar.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.800 line:0%
Princess Runing,

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.400 line:0%
implicated in the Jinxiu Workshop case,

00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:18.400 line:0%
is reflecting at Mingsheng Temple.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:32.340 line:0%
Xu.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.400 line:0%
What?

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:36.020 line:0%
Do you want to lose your head?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.200 line:0%
Or your hands?

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:38.880 line:0%
How could I be so stupid?

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.520 line:0%
I've been set up,

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.880 line:0%
and fallen into a trap.

00:14:42.280 --> 00:14:43.800 line:0%
I'm such a fool.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:47.980 line:0%
What happened?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.690 line:0%
This powder...

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.320 line:0%
I must have gotten it on me

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.520 line:0%
in Mingsheng Temple.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:05.400 line:0%
It looks like

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.800 line:0%
the suspicious powder

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.200 line:0%
around Jinxiu Workshop.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.440 line:0%
I need to calm down and think.

00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:13.330 line:0%
There must be some connection.

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:14.280 line:0%
There must be something

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.280 line:0%
I've overlooked.

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:16.160 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.280 line:0%
Right now, there's

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:19.740 line:0%
someone even more anxious than you outside.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.040 line:0%
I followed all the way,

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:23.560 line:0%
but my horse

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:24.560 line:0%
seemed to be frightened

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:25.880 line:0%
when I reached Chen Shoujie's residence.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:26.280 line:0%
By the time I arrived

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:27.320 line:0%
at Mingsheng Temple,

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.680 line:0%
Princess Runing had already...

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.280 line:0%
Are you sure Yan Xing was acting strangely

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.320 line:0%
after leaving Chen's Mansion?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:31.760 line:0%
Yes,

00:15:31.760 --> 00:15:32.720 line:0%
I called out to Madam several times,

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:33.640 line:0%
but she didn't respond at all.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:34.680 line:0%
She seemed bewitched,

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:35.920 line:0%
chasing after something.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.160 line:0%
I don't care who it is,

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.000 line:0%
but whoever dares

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.120 line:0%
to target my people,

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.600 line:0%
they'll regret it.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.320 line:0%
But Madam was taken

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.520 line:0%
by Princess Runing.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.450 line:0%
This matter might not be so simple.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:55.320 line:0%
There are rules.

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:56.240 line:0%
You can't go in.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.560 line:0%
How could Yan Xing possibly kill someone?

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.820 line:0%
You really can't go in.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:06.190 line:0%
How is Yan Xing?

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:07.640 line:0%
She's fine.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.300 line:0%
She just ate two steamed buns.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:11.720 line:0%
By the way,

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.040 line:0%
she told me

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.240 line:0%
not to inform

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.700 line:0%
her family about this yet.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.040 line:0%
Who exactly

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:18.520 line:0%
set Yan Xing up?

00:16:19.300 --> 00:16:21.240 line:0%
You must find out.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:22.360 line:0%
We also believe

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:24.240 line:0%
that Yan Xing wouldn't kill anyone.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.160 line:0%
But the person who arrested her

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.480 line:0%
is Princess Runing.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:27.800 line:0%
I'm afraid

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.720 line:0%
it won't be easy to investigate.

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:36.700 line:0%
What's so difficult about it?

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.630 line:0%
We have both witnesses and physical evidence.

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.170 line:0%
A life for a life.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.080 line:0%
It's only right and proper.

00:16:51.680 --> 00:16:52.280 line:0%
You...

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:53.360 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:56.800 line:0%
I wonder why you've come to the prison of the Ministry of Justice

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.040 line:0%
so late at night.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.240 line:0%
The incident at Mingsheng Temple

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.120 line:0%
involves a royal princess.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.800 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager wants to interrogate

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:05.280 line:0%
the murderer, Yan Xing.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.960 line:0%
What are you waiting for?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.760 line:0%
Bring the prisoner.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:12.440 line:0%
Yes.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:13.560 line:0%
Wait.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.410 line:0%
What do you mean by this, Grand Commander Shen?

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:32.600 line:0%
Are you trying to shield your wife

00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:33.930 line:0%
and obstruct the trial?

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:35.820 line:0%
Is this a perversion of justice?

00:17:36.260 --> 00:17:38.470 line:0%
Is the Imperial Investigation Department's raid on the prison

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:39.780 line:0%
Her Majesty's will,

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.400 line:0%
or are you abusing your favor

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.020 line:0%
and ignoring the law?

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:55.280 line:0%
The Imperial Investigation Department

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.340 line:0%
has always been loyal to Her Majesty.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.120 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, your words

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.250 line:0%
are quite slanderous.

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:05.610 line:0%
As for today's matter,

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.960 line:0%
I must personally handle it

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:10.460 line:0%
to fulfill Her Majesty's

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:11.890 line:0%
long-standing trust.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.130 line:0%
I will investigate this matter myself.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.710 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.200 line:0%
you may leave.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:25.270 line:0%
Guard this place well.

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.140 line:0%
If anyone dares to approach,

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:28.940 line:0%
consider it a jailbreak attempt

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.130 line:0%
and show no mercy.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:33.200 line:0%
Yes!

00:18:39.670 --> 00:18:40.660 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:18:41.660 --> 00:18:43.440 line:0%
you'd be so convinced that

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.200 line:0%
Mrs. Shen isn't the murderer.

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:47.350 line:0%
I wonder

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.030 line:0%
when Her Majesty learns of this tomorrow,

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.240 line:0%
will she be moved by

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.200 line:0%
your deep marital affection,

00:18:53.930 --> 00:18:57.210 line:0%
or will she order me to carry out the sentence?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.390 line:0%
One night.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:07.470 line:0%
I suggest you

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.890 line:0%
make the most of

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:13.360 line:0%
this night of intimacy.

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:33.880 line:0%
Let's go.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.480 line:0%
We'll return tomorrow.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.320 line:0%
What are you doing here

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:50.440 line:0%
-in the middle of the night?
-Wu.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.280 line:0%
Stop talking.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:51.960 line:0%
Just come with me.

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.620 line:0%
Can't it wait until tomorrow?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:56.080 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:01.120 line:0%
Jing Lin,

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.960 line:0%
you saw with your own eyes that day

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.640 line:0%
after Yan Xing left the Chen's Mansion,

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:06.800 line:0%
she seemed to be chasing someone,

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:08.960 line:0%
riding all the way to the woods west of the city.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:09.760 line:0%
Yes.

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:12.780 line:0%
Yan Xing said

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:13.720 line:0%
she discovered

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:15.120 line:0%
the Chen family's servant had forged a testimony,

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.740 line:0%
so she went to the Chen's Mansion

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:18.600 line:0%
and found he was trying to escape.

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:20.360 line:0%
So she chased him all the way to Mingsheng Temple.

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:21.160 line:0%
That's right.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.130 line:0%
That's exactly what Yan Xing said.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:25.800 line:0%
Then something's not right.

00:20:30.280 --> 00:20:31.080 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.600 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:34.700 line:0%
Lift your foot.

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.210 line:0%
I see.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:50.440 line:0%
The woods in the west of the city are muddy.

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.960 line:0%
If one were riding a fast horse,

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:53.700 line:0%
the trouser cuffs couldn't be this clean.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:54.720 line:0%
I must have dirtied my shoes

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.600 line:0%
on the way to Mingsheng Temple

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:56.600 line:0%
following Madam.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.120 line:0%
But the servant's shoes

00:20:58.120 --> 00:20:59.290 line:0%
are spotless.

00:20:59.680 --> 00:21:00.560 line:0%
So how did the body

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.090 line:0%
end up at Mingsheng Temple?

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:14.920 line:0%
This smell...

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:16.910 line:0%
Could it be...

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.760 line:0%
The Mingsheng Temple case

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:23.900 line:0%
has many suspicious points.

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:25.040 line:0%
Before tomorrow,

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:27.600 line:0%
no one is allowed to interrogate the suspect.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.280 line:0%
But what if...

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:29.240 line:0%
If a single hair of Yan Xing

00:21:29.240 --> 00:21:30.640 line:0%
is missing in the prison,

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:32.190 line:0%
I'll hold you accountable.

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:35.560 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:37.690 line:0%
where should we investigate next?

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.080 line:0%
The source of the mistake.

00:22:12.300 --> 00:22:13.280 line:0%
[Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.
Immortal reincarnation]

00:22:13.380 --> 00:22:16.610 line:0%
[Moths to a flame
Born at dawn, dead by dusk]

00:22:19.710 --> 00:22:21.870 line:0%
[Moths to a flame
Born at dawn, dead by dusk
Not entering the cycle of reincarnation.
Immortal reincarnation]

00:22:50.680 --> 00:22:51.480 line:0%
This powder is very similar to

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:53.160 line:0%
the one that appeared at Jinxiu Workshop.

00:22:53.160 --> 00:22:53.960 line:0%
Could it be

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:54.880 line:0%
that Madam was set up

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:55.800 line:0%
right here?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.260 line:0%
Fire moths! Fire moths! Fire moths!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.190 line:0%
What was originally placed here?

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:41.610 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:23:41.610 --> 00:23:42.440 line:0%
there doesn't seem to be any

00:23:42.440 --> 00:23:44.500 line:0%
signs of searching or fighting here.

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:01.790 line:0%
So much blood.

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:03.080 line:0%
It looks like this is

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:04.720 line:0%
the scene of the crime.

00:24:04.840 --> 00:24:06.040 line:0%
Then how did

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:08.270 line:0%
the victim end up at Mingsheng Temple?

00:24:11.040 --> 00:24:12.360 line:0%
It's a box.

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:15.220 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:17.000 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:19.860 line:0%
this is Prince Xian's whereabouts from last night.

00:24:21.060 --> 00:24:23.270 line:0%
[Prince Xian met Princess Runing privately at Mingsheng Temple last night.]

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:24.680 line:0%
As expected.

00:24:26.680 --> 00:24:27.280 line:0%
If they find out

00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:28.600 line:0%
that you had someone

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:30.340 line:0%
keep an eye on Prince Xian,

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:31.720 line:0%
-I'm afraid...
-Saving her is the priority.

00:24:30.590 --> 00:24:30.770 line:0%
[Prince Xian met Princess Runing privately at Mingsheng Temple last night.]

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:33.320 line:0%
It seems I'll have to meet

00:24:33.320 --> 00:24:34.920 line:0%
this Princess Runing myself.

00:24:34.280 --> 00:24:37.680 line:0%
[Mingsheng Temple]

00:24:57.050 --> 00:24:59.190 line:0%
I am Shen Du, the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:24:59.190 --> 00:25:00.790 line:0%
Greetings to Your Highness.

00:25:02.350 --> 00:25:03.580 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:25:03.580 --> 00:25:05.850 line:0%
known as the renowned White Ghost.

00:25:06.360 --> 00:25:07.480 line:0%
Who are you here

00:25:07.500 --> 00:25:08.780 line:0%
to arrest today?

00:25:08.800 --> 00:25:10.290 line:0%
Your Highness misunderstands.

00:25:10.290 --> 00:25:12.690 line:0%
I came today to ask for a favor.

00:25:14.910 --> 00:25:16.500 line:0%
Grand Commander, you jest.

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:18.320 line:0%
I am no longer a princess,

00:25:18.320 --> 00:25:19.750 line:0%
just a commoner now.

00:25:20.070 --> 00:25:22.470 line:0%
What favor could you possibly want from me?

00:25:22.600 --> 00:25:23.400 line:0%
Please leave.

00:25:23.400 --> 00:25:24.440 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:25:25.180 --> 00:25:26.960 line:0%
please hear my request.

00:25:28.010 --> 00:25:29.870 line:0%
If it's about court matters,

00:25:30.330 --> 00:25:31.750 line:0%
they have nothing to do with me anymore.

00:25:31.750 --> 00:25:33.750 line:0%
There's no need for you to continue.

00:25:36.280 --> 00:25:38.410 line:0%
It's a personal family matter of mine.

00:25:43.250 --> 00:25:44.280 line:0%
Family matter?

00:25:44.500 --> 00:25:46.410 line:0%
Yesterday, my wife was framed by someone

00:25:46.410 --> 00:25:47.660 line:0%
and accidentally trespassed into Mingsheng Temple.

00:25:47.660 --> 00:25:48.920 line:0%
Now she's imprisoned.

00:25:49.070 --> 00:25:51.270 line:0%
I hope Your Highness can show leniency.

00:25:53.530 --> 00:25:55.240 line:0%
I can't believe you're here

00:25:55.240 --> 00:25:56.280 line:0%
for your wife.

00:25:58.230 --> 00:25:59.840 line:0%
This is quite different from the rumors about

00:25:59.840 --> 00:26:01.400 line:0%
the ruthless White Ghost.

00:26:02.440 --> 00:26:03.200 line:0%
You want me to

00:26:03.200 --> 00:26:04.200 line:0%
release your wife?

00:26:04.200 --> 00:26:06.200 line:0%
I want you to give me the truth.

00:26:12.420 --> 00:26:13.600 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:26:13.920 --> 00:26:14.960 line:0%
Are you saying I slandered

00:26:14.960 --> 00:26:16.000 line:0%
your wife?

00:26:16.270 --> 00:26:19.590 line:0%
Your Highness certainly wouldn't slander intentionally,

00:26:19.590 --> 00:26:21.850 line:0%
but if you're trying to protect someone,

00:26:24.730 --> 00:26:27.080 line:0%
you might withhold some information.

00:26:30.780 --> 00:26:32.220 line:0%
Nonsense.

00:26:32.600 --> 00:26:33.400 line:0%
I'm tired.

00:26:33.400 --> 00:26:34.640 line:0%
Please leave.

00:26:34.840 --> 00:26:36.370 line:0%
At the time of the incident,

00:26:36.970 --> 00:26:39.370 line:0%
were you really alone at Mingsheng Temple?

00:26:39.740 --> 00:26:41.210 line:0%
No one else came here?

00:26:44.440 --> 00:26:46.900 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has confined you.

00:26:47.150 --> 00:26:50.410 line:0%
If she knew about your secret meeting with the Prince Xian,

00:26:50.590 --> 00:26:52.310 line:0%
I wonder how she would feel.

00:26:55.590 --> 00:26:56.990 line:0%
Are you threatening me?

00:26:57.210 --> 00:26:59.020 line:0%
I just want the truth.

00:27:05.010 --> 00:27:05.840 line:0%
He just

00:27:05.840 --> 00:27:07.840 line:0%
came to visit his lonely

00:27:07.840 --> 00:27:08.840 line:0%
and helpless aunt,

00:27:08.840 --> 00:27:10.320 line:0%
brought some items,

00:27:10.320 --> 00:27:11.720 line:0%
and had a cup of tea.

00:27:11.760 --> 00:27:13.080 line:0%
He never talked about state affairs,

00:27:13.080 --> 00:27:14.520 line:0%
nor did he have any ulterior motives.

00:27:14.520 --> 00:27:15.760 line:0%
This is just

00:27:15.760 --> 00:27:16.720 line:0%
a family courtesy.

00:27:16.720 --> 00:27:18.180 line:0%
Is that so hard to believe?

00:27:18.310 --> 00:27:20.170 line:0%
Prince Xian values family bonds,

00:27:22.170 --> 00:27:23.040 line:0%
but others

00:27:23.040 --> 00:27:24.440 line:0%
might not see it that way.

00:27:25.090 --> 00:27:26.020 line:0%
Sometimes,

00:27:26.720 --> 00:27:27.440 line:0%
just one word

00:27:27.440 --> 00:27:29.380 line:0%
can cause someone to die unjustly.

00:27:30.930 --> 00:27:33.130 line:0%
Your Highness, please tell me the truth

00:27:33.640 --> 00:27:35.230 line:0%
and clear my wife's name.

00:27:47.240 --> 00:27:48.080 line:0%
Open it.

00:27:51.680 --> 00:27:52.480 line:0%
Indeed,

00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:54.720 line:0%
I didn't see your wife kill anyone with my own eyes.

00:27:54.720 --> 00:27:56.120 line:0%
When I arrived,

00:27:56.120 --> 00:27:56.960 line:0%
the hall only

00:27:56.960 --> 00:27:58.840 line:0%
had her and the body.

00:28:00.080 --> 00:28:01.200 line:0%
I didn't want others to know

00:28:01.200 --> 00:28:02.520 line:0%
that Prince Xian had been there,

00:28:02.520 --> 00:28:03.400 line:0%
so I let them

00:28:03.400 --> 00:28:04.880 line:0%
leave through the back door first.

00:28:04.880 --> 00:28:06.520 line:0%
Later, when I checked the back door,

00:28:06.520 --> 00:28:07.440 line:0%
I did find

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:09.040 line:0%
signs of forced entry.

00:28:09.880 --> 00:28:10.960 line:0%
Among the items

00:28:10.960 --> 00:28:12.160 line:0%
Prince Xian brought,

00:28:12.520 --> 00:28:14.160 line:0%
I found this box,

00:28:14.640 --> 00:28:16.640 line:0%
but I have no idea where it came from.

00:28:17.680 --> 00:28:19.520 line:0%
Thank you for telling the truth.

00:28:20.200 --> 00:28:23.060 line:0%
I apologize for any offense I may have caused today.

00:28:25.690 --> 00:28:28.240 line:0%
Grand Commander, you'd better watch yourself.

00:28:28.240 --> 00:28:30.020 line:0%
If anything happens to Prince Xian,

00:28:30.020 --> 00:28:31.960 line:0%
I will certainly inform Her Majesty

00:28:31.960 --> 00:28:33.970 line:0%
about your surveillance of the royal family.

00:28:33.970 --> 00:28:35.500 line:0%
Your Highness, do you think

00:28:35.950 --> 00:28:37.410 line:0%
I would be so bold

00:28:38.490 --> 00:28:39.980 line:0%
as to act on my own?

00:28:48.660 --> 00:28:49.560 line:0%
I hope that from now on,

00:28:49.560 --> 00:28:51.480 line:0%
we'll have more peaceful days.

00:28:57.240 --> 00:28:59.300 line:0%
Your Highness, don't you want to know

00:28:59.880 --> 00:29:02.410 line:0%
the truth about the Jinxiu Workshop case from back then?

00:29:02.410 --> 00:29:04.470 line:0%
What good would knowing the truth do?

00:29:05.780 --> 00:29:07.020 line:0%
The dead

00:29:07.640 --> 00:29:09.040 line:0%
can never come back.

00:29:09.670 --> 00:29:11.000 line:0%
The deceased have passed on

00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:12.080 line:0%
and found peace.

00:29:12.120 --> 00:29:12.800 line:0%
It's nothing more than

00:29:12.800 --> 00:29:14.880 line:0%
a comforting phrase for the living.

00:29:15.530 --> 00:29:17.360 line:0%
What really happened with that case?

00:29:17.360 --> 00:29:18.600 line:0%
No one dared to investigate it back then.

00:29:18.600 --> 00:29:20.200 line:0%
What can be done about it now?

00:29:20.460 --> 00:29:21.880 line:0%
I, Shen Du, promise today

00:29:22.380 --> 00:29:25.240 line:0%
to thoroughly investigate what happened back then

00:29:25.840 --> 00:29:27.550 line:0%
and reveal the truth.

00:29:31.200 --> 00:29:32.000 line:0%
Very well.

00:29:32.020 --> 00:29:33.790 line:0%
Then I'll wait for your truth.

00:29:49.230 --> 00:29:50.390 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:29:50.520 --> 00:29:52.680 line:0%
Mingsheng Temple is a place of controversy.

00:29:52.680 --> 00:29:53.880 line:0%
If Her Majesty learns

00:29:53.880 --> 00:29:54.960 line:0%
that you've been there,

00:29:54.960 --> 00:29:56.040 line:0%
she will surely accuse you of

00:29:56.040 --> 00:29:56.880 line:0%
forming factions

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:58.760 line:0%
and plotting treason.

00:30:00.560 --> 00:30:01.840 line:0%
When one wants to frame someone,

00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:03.440 line:0%
they'll always find a way.

00:30:08.560 --> 00:30:09.320 line:0%
Back then, my aunt

00:30:09.320 --> 00:30:11.920 line:0%
was involved in the Jinxiu Workshop bloodshed

00:30:11.970 --> 00:30:14.280 line:0%
all because of a single piece of clothing.

00:30:14.280 --> 00:30:16.270 line:0%
Be careful with your words, Your Highness.

00:30:16.270 --> 00:30:17.460 line:0%
Be careful.

00:30:17.730 --> 00:30:19.320 line:0%
You've just made a charitable gesture for disaster relief,

00:30:19.320 --> 00:30:20.880 line:0%
which pleased Her Majesty.

00:30:20.880 --> 00:30:22.400 line:0%
You must not do

00:30:22.400 --> 00:30:24.760 line:0%
anything to upset Her Majesty.

00:30:25.200 --> 00:30:26.720 line:0%
Don't neglect the small details.

00:30:26.720 --> 00:30:29.920 line:0%
You might lose the big picture because of small mistakes.

00:30:31.580 --> 00:30:33.440 line:0%
Shen Du has long been aware of this matter,

00:30:33.440 --> 00:30:34.770 line:0%
yet he didn't report it.

00:30:36.450 --> 00:30:38.260 line:0%
He's quite cunning.

00:30:53.210 --> 00:30:55.010 line:0%
It's almost dawn.

00:30:55.040 --> 00:30:57.640 line:0%
Why hasn't Grand Commander Shen returned yet?

00:30:58.390 --> 00:30:59.470 line:0%
It's about time.

00:30:59.920 --> 00:31:01.250 line:0%
Bring out the prisoner.

00:31:09.520 --> 00:31:11.520 line:0%
You'er quite stubborn, aren't you?

00:31:11.920 --> 00:31:13.310 line:0%
I remember back then,

00:31:13.880 --> 00:31:16.290 line:0%
you were defeated by Shen Du.

00:31:17.420 --> 00:31:19.650 line:0%
Now you're following his orders.

00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:22.200 line:0%
By the Grand Empress Dowager's decree,

00:31:22.250 --> 00:31:24.680 line:0%
Lord Lai is to conduct the interrogation at 9 a.m.

00:31:24.680 --> 00:31:25.880 line:0%
The prisoner must not

00:31:25.910 --> 00:31:27.370 line:0%
be brought before then.

00:31:35.610 --> 00:31:37.330 line:0%
You constable,

00:31:37.940 --> 00:31:42.140 line:0%
how dare you obstruct the Imperial Investigation Department's business?

00:31:44.600 --> 00:31:46.220 line:0%
Let me see just

00:31:47.720 --> 00:31:49.320 line:0%
how tough

00:31:49.730 --> 00:31:51.370 line:0%
you are.

00:31:51.400 --> 00:31:53.260 line:0%
Lord Lai, you're quite imposing.

00:31:54.200 --> 00:31:55.130 line:0%
But you seem

00:31:55.650 --> 00:31:56.850 line:0%
a bit too eager.

00:32:21.360 --> 00:32:23.180 line:0%
Working for Her Majesty,

00:32:23.410 --> 00:32:25.870 line:0%
I should certainly do my utmost.

00:32:33.250 --> 00:32:35.310 line:0%
I now announce Her Majesty's decree.

00:32:39.260 --> 00:32:42.000 line:0%
The Mingsheng Temple case has many suspicious points.

00:32:42.000 --> 00:32:45.200 line:0%
It is now fully entrusted to the Imperial Security Bureau

00:32:47.070 --> 00:32:48.530 line:0%
for a full investigation.

00:32:55.140 --> 00:32:56.800 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:32:57.280 --> 00:32:59.360 line:0%
you're perfect in time.

00:33:02.480 --> 00:33:03.280 line:0%
Let's go.

00:33:14.080 --> 00:33:15.740 line:0%
Why isn't she coming out yet?

00:33:16.030 --> 00:33:17.330 line:0%
Please, please.

00:33:17.350 --> 00:33:18.720 line:0%
Come out quickly.

00:33:20.100 --> 00:33:21.040 line:0%
Xing,

00:33:21.080 --> 00:33:22.360 line:0%
you're finally out.

00:33:22.360 --> 00:33:24.010 line:0%
I was so worried about you.

00:33:24.200 --> 00:33:25.000 line:0%
Come on,

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:26.330 line:0%
sweep the bad luck away.

00:33:26.360 --> 00:33:26.960 line:0%
It's good that you

00:33:26.960 --> 00:33:28.320 line:0%
came out safe and sound.

00:33:30.170 --> 00:33:31.480 line:0%
Well,

00:33:31.720 --> 00:33:32.680 line:0%
what case were you investigating

00:33:32.680 --> 00:33:34.320 line:0%
that got you into trouble?

00:33:35.050 --> 00:33:35.850 line:0%
But

00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.880 line:0%
it's good that you came out safe and sound.

00:33:37.880 --> 00:33:38.680 line:0%
Do you know

00:33:38.680 --> 00:33:40.040 line:0%
how worried I was

00:33:40.040 --> 00:33:40.520 line:0%
when I heard you were

00:33:40.520 --> 00:33:42.040 line:0%
arrested for murder?

00:33:42.360 --> 00:33:43.480 line:0%
Sweep here and there

00:33:43.480 --> 00:33:44.240 line:0%
to ward off bad luck.

00:33:44.240 --> 00:33:45.120 line:0%
Turn around, turn around.

00:33:45.120 --> 00:33:46.850 line:0%
I'm blessed with good fortune.

00:33:47.040 --> 00:33:48.200 line:0%
Now the case's cleared up,

00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:49.480 line:0%
so I was released.

00:33:49.480 --> 00:33:51.080 line:0%
If it weren't for Grand Commander Shen

00:33:51.080 --> 00:33:52.160 line:0%
going to find Princess Runing

00:33:52.160 --> 00:33:53.320 line:0%
to explain the situation,

00:33:53.320 --> 00:33:55.240 line:0%
and finding the box used to transport the body

00:33:55.240 --> 00:33:56.000 line:0%
by those who framed you

00:33:56.000 --> 00:33:57.000 line:0%
in the woods behind

00:33:57.000 --> 00:33:57.760 line:0%
Mingsheng Temple,

00:33:57.760 --> 00:33:58.320 line:0%
you wouldn't have

00:33:58.320 --> 00:33:59.720 line:0%
been released so easily.

00:33:59.920 --> 00:34:01.590 line:0%
He went to find the Princess?

00:34:03.890 --> 00:34:05.090 line:0%
What did you just say?

00:34:05.680 --> 00:34:06.960 line:0%
The box used to transport the body

00:34:06.960 --> 00:34:08.420 line:0%
was thrown into the woods?

00:34:10.120 --> 00:34:11.120 line:0%
That's not right.

00:34:11.249 --> 00:34:12.439 line:0%
What's not right?

00:34:13.280 --> 00:34:14.939 line:0%
You must have been terrified.

00:34:15.400 --> 00:34:16.280 line:0%
It's okay now.

00:34:17.240 --> 00:34:17.950 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:34:17.950 --> 00:34:20.280 line:0%
Xu and Jiang Langxing

00:34:20.280 --> 00:34:21.030 line:0%
have gone to investigate

00:34:21.030 --> 00:34:22.320 line:0%
new leads.

00:34:22.470 --> 00:34:23.200 line:0%
I heard that

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:24.950 line:0%
the dead servant of the Chen family

00:34:24.950 --> 00:34:26.990 line:0%
had been stealing from the Chen's assets

00:34:26.990 --> 00:34:28.850 line:0%
while Chen Shoujie was confused.

00:34:29.320 --> 00:34:31.280 line:0%
Later, Mrs. Chen discovered it.

00:34:31.360 --> 00:34:32.470 line:0%
So he betrayed his master.

00:34:32.470 --> 00:34:33.240 line:0%
He probably colluded with

00:34:33.240 --> 00:34:34.200 line:0%
someone outside

00:34:34.580 --> 00:34:35.910 line:0%
and struck a fatal blow.

00:34:36.550 --> 00:34:38.510 line:0%
It's a pity there's no one left to testify.

00:34:38.510 --> 00:34:39.320 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:34:48.160 --> 00:34:48.950 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:34:48.950 --> 00:34:50.990 line:0%
Are you here to take Xing back home?

00:34:51.510 --> 00:34:52.430 line:0%
Back home?

00:34:52.560 --> 00:34:53.760 line:0%
I'm full of energy right now.

00:34:53.760 --> 00:34:54.430 line:0%
I'm going to investigate the case

00:34:54.430 --> 00:34:55.950 line:0%
and clear my own name.

00:34:59.760 --> 00:35:00.560 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:35:00.560 --> 00:35:01.120 line:0%
From now on,

00:35:01.120 --> 00:35:02.880 line:0%
you're not allowed to investigate this case.

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:04.200 line:0%
I've already come this far in the investigation.

00:35:04.200 --> 00:35:05.100 line:0%
How can you expect me

00:35:05.100 --> 00:35:06.340 line:0%
to back out now?

00:35:06.440 --> 00:35:07.240 line:0%
Also,

00:35:07.600 --> 00:35:08.960 line:0%
the body of the Chen family's servant

00:35:08.960 --> 00:35:10.080 line:0%
should be at the Ministry of Justice.

00:35:10.080 --> 00:35:11.280 line:0%
I must find clues

00:35:11.280 --> 00:35:12.200 line:0%
from his body.

00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:14.060 line:0%
I said you can't investigate.

00:35:14.480 --> 00:35:16.040 line:0%
The real culprit used the servant

00:35:16.040 --> 00:35:17.440 line:0%
to lure me to Mingsheng Temple,

00:35:17.440 --> 00:35:18.760 line:0%
obviously trying to make me

00:35:18.760 --> 00:35:20.280 line:0%
suspect Princess Runing.

00:35:20.310 --> 00:35:21.200 line:0%
Princess Runing

00:35:21.200 --> 00:35:22.620 line:0%
hasn't left Mingsheng Temple in years.

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:23.560 line:0%
Who would want to

00:35:23.560 --> 00:35:24.800 line:0%
drag her into this?

00:35:24.800 --> 00:35:25.560 line:0%
Enough.

00:35:29.340 --> 00:35:31.470 line:0%
Is it because it might be related to the royal family

00:35:31.470 --> 00:35:34.000 line:0%
that you want me to give up the investigation?

00:35:37.580 --> 00:35:38.910 line:0%
Leave this matter to me.

00:35:39.170 --> 00:35:40.280 line:0%
I will handle it properly.

00:35:40.280 --> 00:35:42.680 line:0%
I just want to uncover the truth of the case.

00:35:42.700 --> 00:35:44.040 line:0%
Since you, Grand Commander Shen,

00:35:44.040 --> 00:35:44.760 line:0%
are so timid,

00:35:44.760 --> 00:35:45.640 line:0%
and afraid of the powerful,

00:35:45.640 --> 00:35:46.360 line:0%
fine.

00:35:46.440 --> 00:35:47.960 line:0%
I'll investigate this case myself.

00:35:47.960 --> 00:35:49.440 line:0%
You can just

00:35:49.440 --> 00:35:50.400 line:0%
keep walking

00:35:50.400 --> 00:35:51.360 line:0%
your own path.

00:35:51.360 --> 00:35:52.560 line:0%
So this is what you think of me.

00:35:52.560 --> 00:35:53.360 line:0%
Aren't you always afraid

00:35:53.360 --> 00:35:54.080 line:0%
of being implicated by others?

00:35:54.080 --> 00:35:55.400 line:0%
Then let's divorce right now.

00:35:55.400 --> 00:35:56.520 line:0%
So you won't have to write

00:35:56.520 --> 00:35:57.650 line:0%
a confession later.

00:35:57.760 --> 00:35:58.560 line:0%
Xing,

00:36:20.440 --> 00:36:21.640 line:0%
what should we do now?

00:36:26.680 --> 00:36:27.480 line:0%
Where are you going?

00:36:27.480 --> 00:36:28.610 line:0%
To examine the body.

00:36:42.690 --> 00:36:44.550 line:0%
Shen Du checked the body before.

00:36:45.200 --> 00:36:45.960 line:0%
His shoes

00:36:45.960 --> 00:36:47.690 line:0%
weren't dirty with forest mud.

00:36:48.190 --> 00:36:49.320 line:0%
The body was moved

00:36:49.320 --> 00:36:51.180 line:0%
to Mingsheng Temple after death.

00:37:03.640 --> 00:37:04.440 line:0%
What?

00:37:04.480 --> 00:37:05.810 line:0%
Did you find something?

00:37:06.400 --> 00:37:07.530 line:0%
Come and smell this.

00:37:08.760 --> 00:37:09.720 line:0%
This smell

00:37:09.720 --> 00:37:12.450 line:0%
is from something used to delay the body's decay.

00:37:12.480 --> 00:37:13.320 line:0%
He was

00:37:13.320 --> 00:37:14.980 line:0%
already dead when I arrived at

00:37:15.280 --> 00:37:16.800 line:0%
Chen Shoujie's residence.

00:37:16.800 --> 00:37:18.430 line:0%
As for what happened afterwards,

00:37:18.430 --> 00:37:20.690 line:0%
although I witnessed it with my own eyes,

00:37:20.800 --> 00:37:22.160 line:0%
I can't be certain

00:37:22.180 --> 00:37:23.310 line:0%
that it was reality.

00:37:24.090 --> 00:37:25.450 line:0%
Are you saying

00:37:25.670 --> 00:37:27.930 line:0%
that everything you saw was an illusion?

00:37:28.740 --> 00:37:29.900 line:0%
What kind of thing

00:37:30.100 --> 00:37:32.110 line:0%
or drug could

00:37:32.520 --> 00:37:34.450 line:0%
control people's minds like that?

00:37:36.610 --> 00:37:37.910 line:0%
The world is vast

00:37:38.320 --> 00:37:39.450 line:0%
and full of wonders.

00:37:40.200 --> 00:37:41.080 line:0%
I suppose

00:37:41.920 --> 00:37:43.920 line:0%
it's far beyond our understanding.

00:37:44.920 --> 00:37:45.720 line:0%
Moreover,

00:37:46.010 --> 00:37:47.550 line:0%
I'm more worried that

00:37:48.000 --> 00:37:49.440 line:0%
the method this servant used

00:37:49.440 --> 00:37:50.160 line:0%
to delay

00:37:50.160 --> 00:37:51.640 line:0%
the body's decay

00:37:51.680 --> 00:37:52.880 line:0%
is the same as what Mrs. Tang

00:37:52.880 --> 00:37:53.840 line:0%
used back then.

00:37:55.120 --> 00:37:56.650 line:0%
Do you believe there's a way

00:37:57.200 --> 00:37:58.920 line:0%
to bring the dead back to life?

00:38:00.130 --> 00:38:01.980 line:0%
Are you worried that Chen Huo'e

00:38:02.400 --> 00:38:03.680 line:0%
might actually come back from the dead

00:38:03.680 --> 00:38:04.880 line:0%
like people say?

00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:05.800 line:0%
Yes.

00:38:09.160 --> 00:38:10.220 line:0%
I don't believe it.

00:38:10.860 --> 00:38:12.730 line:0%
That's why I must find the truth.

00:38:12.920 --> 00:38:13.720 line:0%
So,

00:38:13.720 --> 00:38:14.760 line:0%
you had an argument with your husband

00:38:14.760 --> 00:38:16.020 line:0%
and ran away from home?

00:38:19.180 --> 00:38:20.430 line:0%
I'm just afraid that

00:38:20.480 --> 00:38:21.120 line:0%
without

00:38:21.120 --> 00:38:22.320 line:0%
White Ghost's protection,

00:38:22.320 --> 00:38:23.720 line:0%
someone might bully you.

00:38:23.960 --> 00:38:24.960 line:0%
I'm not afraid.

00:38:25.240 --> 00:38:26.840 line:0%
I still have you guys, right?

00:38:28.400 --> 00:38:29.880 line:0%
If you go home and your mother finds out,

00:38:29.880 --> 00:38:31.540 line:0%
she'll definitely scold you.

00:38:31.880 --> 00:38:32.760 line:0%
Don't worry,

00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:34.940 line:0%
I've already figured out where to go.

00:38:35.180 --> 00:38:41.320 line:0%
[History Archive]

00:38:35.920 --> 00:38:37.680 line:0%
This place holds all the case files

00:38:37.680 --> 00:38:39.760 line:0%
from the Ministry of Justice over the years.

00:38:39.760 --> 00:38:40.640 line:0%
I'm sure I can

00:38:40.940 --> 00:38:42.360 line:0%
find some clues here.

00:38:46.320 --> 00:38:47.200 line:0%
Miss Yan.

00:38:47.280 --> 00:38:48.080 line:0%
Official Ji.

00:39:00.440 --> 00:39:02.170 line:0%
Why are you coming here so late?

00:39:02.320 --> 00:39:03.120 line:0%
Official Ji,

00:39:03.140 --> 00:39:04.440 line:0%
I want to look for

00:39:04.440 --> 00:39:05.560 line:0%
all the records around

00:39:05.440 --> 00:39:06.940 line:0%
[Ji Fangming, Director of History Archive]

00:39:05.560 --> 00:39:07.600 line:0%
the time of the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:39:07.600 --> 00:39:09.200 line:0%
You've been in charge of the History Archive for years.

00:39:09.200 --> 00:39:10.560 line:0%
Do you know where they might be?

00:39:10.560 --> 00:39:11.760 line:0%
Jinxiu Workshop...

00:39:11.880 --> 00:39:13.210 line:0%
It's been quite a while.

00:39:14.680 --> 00:39:15.640 line:0%
Perhaps over there.

00:39:15.640 --> 00:39:16.700 line:0%
You can take a look.

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:17.600 line:0%
Thank you.

00:39:20.690 --> 00:39:22.110 line:0%
This scent...

00:39:23.660 --> 00:39:25.390 line:0%
Where have I smelled it before?

00:39:28.900 --> 00:39:29.760 line:0%
Miss Yan.

00:39:32.100 --> 00:39:33.500 line:0%
Be careful with the fire.

00:39:34.630 --> 00:39:35.750 line:0%
Thank you.

00:39:35.780 --> 00:39:37.690 line:0%
I'll be very cautious.

00:40:12.390 --> 00:40:13.240 line:0%
Aren't you always afraid

00:40:13.240 --> 00:40:14.200 line:0%
of being implicated by others?

00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:15.580 line:0%
Then let's divorce right now.

00:40:15.580 --> 00:40:16.690 line:0%
So you won't have to write

00:40:16.690 --> 00:40:17.880 line:0%
a confession later.

00:40:27.400 --> 00:40:28.200 line:0%
Mother.

00:40:32.480 --> 00:40:33.280 line:0%
Oranges.

00:40:34.170 --> 00:40:35.980 line:0%
The branches of the orange tree outside the wall

00:40:35.980 --> 00:40:37.350 line:0%
just fell into the garden.

00:40:36.100 --> 00:40:41.250 line:0%
♫For the sake of an end, I embraced silence and became a Shura♫

00:40:37.440 --> 00:40:39.470 line:0%
I know you like oranges,

00:40:39.800 --> 00:40:41.130 line:0%
so I picked some for you.

00:40:43.090 --> 00:40:47.930 line:0%
♫Love is elusive, piercing you and burning me♫

00:40:43.440 --> 00:40:45.040 line:0%
Have you written

00:40:45.640 --> 00:40:47.040 line:0%
what I asked you to write?

00:40:48.560 --> 00:40:49.600 line:0%
I won't write it.

00:40:49.750 --> 00:40:51.010 line:0%
I can't write it either.

00:40:50.260 --> 00:40:53.900 line:0%
♫Along the way, flowers bloom and fall, rain pours heavily♫

00:40:51.040 --> 00:40:53.040 line:0%
Father served as an official his whole life with integrity.

00:40:53.040 --> 00:40:54.320 line:0%
He never did anything

00:40:54.170 --> 00:40:56.670 line:0%
♫Lights will cross♫

00:40:54.320 --> 00:40:56.780 line:0%
against the Shen family's ancestral rules.

00:40:57.170 --> 00:40:58.970 line:0%
Father was framed.

00:40:57.930 --> 00:41:01.680 line:0%
♫You are my destination♫

00:40:59.000 --> 00:41:00.430 line:0%
How could I admit

00:41:00.560 --> 00:41:02.080 line:0%
those false charges on behalf of him?

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:02.840 line:0%
Shut up!

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:05.500 line:0%
You are a criminal by association.

00:41:03.840 --> 00:41:06.270 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my loneliness and confusion?♫

00:41:05.810 --> 00:41:08.270 line:0%
If you don't distance yourself from the Shen family,

00:41:06.950 --> 00:41:10.060 line:0%
♫Understanding my fragility, no words are needed♫

00:41:08.540 --> 00:41:09.480 line:0%
you will never have

00:41:09.480 --> 00:41:10.960 line:0%
a chance to rise again!

00:41:11.090 --> 00:41:13.380 line:0%
♫Who will save me from my panic and obsession?♫

00:41:13.990 --> 00:41:14.840 line:0%
But how could I

00:41:14.090 --> 00:41:16.990 line:0%
♫Sheltering my solitude, never letting me fall♫

00:41:14.840 --> 00:41:16.240 line:0%
live for myself alone

00:41:16.780 --> 00:41:18.720 line:0%
and let Father be condemned by the world?

00:41:17.870 --> 00:41:20.910 line:0%
♫The chains of fate between us cannot be broken♫

00:41:19.080 --> 00:41:20.310 line:0%
Rather than that,

00:41:20.400 --> 00:41:21.920 line:0%
I'd rather die like Father

00:41:22.000 --> 00:41:23.240 line:0%
to prove my innocence.

00:41:22.300 --> 00:41:25.830 line:0%
♫Holding the warmth you once gave♫

00:41:24.910 --> 00:41:26.740 line:0%
But if even you die too,

00:41:25.940 --> 00:41:30.750 line:0%
♫Guiding me to see myself, the person I truly am♫

00:41:26.760 --> 00:41:28.010 line:0%
this wrongful case

00:41:28.190 --> 00:41:29.920 line:0%
will truly be settled.

00:41:30.040 --> 00:41:31.050 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:41:31.820 --> 00:41:33.700 line:0%
do you really want them

00:41:32.500 --> 00:41:34.820 line:0%
♫Who will save me from right and wrong?♫

00:41:33.720 --> 00:41:35.040 line:0%
to remain restless

00:41:35.070 --> 00:41:36.990 line:0%
in the afterlife?

00:41:35.830 --> 00:41:38.130 line:0%
♫Tossed in the sea of people, just hold me tight♫

00:41:39.280 --> 00:41:41.390 line:0%
If you don't write that confession,

00:41:39.720 --> 00:41:41.940 line:0%
♫Who will save me from grudges and karma?♫

00:41:42.030 --> 00:41:43.510 line:0%
I'm no longer

00:41:42.980 --> 00:41:45.240 line:0%
♫Healing my sorrow, never letting me escape♫

00:41:44.480 --> 00:41:46.280 line:0%
your mother from now on.

00:41:46.670 --> 00:41:49.340 line:0%
♫The past fades, how many times have we met?♫

00:41:46.920 --> 00:41:48.580 line:0%
For your father's innocence,

00:41:49.560 --> 00:41:51.200 line:0%
for the Shen family's honor,

00:41:50.830 --> 00:41:53.620 line:0%
♫Who can break free from destiny?♫

00:41:52.690 --> 00:41:54.250 line:0%
no matter how difficult,

00:41:54.810 --> 00:41:56.070 line:0%
or dangerous it is,

00:41:55.110 --> 00:41:59.560 line:0%
♫I'll cross rivers and leap into fire for you♫

00:41:56.580 --> 00:41:58.540 line:0%
you must keep going.